 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！雨过天晴，天上挂着一道彩虹。今天，我们来学颜色！"
    },
    {
     "en": "colours"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:colour",
    "focus:colour"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "颜色，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "colour"
    },
    {
     "zh": "在美国，它写作 c o l o r，少了一个字母 u，读音一样。",
     "cue": [
      "alt:colour"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "What colour is it?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我们沿着彩虹，一个颜色一个颜色地认。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:red",
    "focus:red"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "彩虹最外面，是红色，像红红的苹果："
    },
    {
     "en": "red"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:orange",
    "edge:red>orange",
    "focus:orange"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "橙色，和橙子是同一个词："
    },
    {
     "en": "orange"
    },
    {
     "en": "an orange orange!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:yellow",
    "edge:orange>yellow",
    "focus:yellow"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "黄色，像香蕉："
    },
    {
     "en": "yellow"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:green",
    "edge:yellow>green",
    "focus:green"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "绿色，像树叶："
    },
    {
     "en": "green"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:blue",
    "edge:green>blue",
    "focus:blue"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "蓝色，像大海和天空："
    },
    {
     "en": "blue"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:purple",
    "edge:blue>purple",
    "focus:purple"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "紫色，像一串葡萄："
    },
    {
     "en": "purple"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:pink",
    "focus:pink"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "红色里加上白色，就变成了可爱的粉色："
    },
    {
     "en": "pink"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:brown",
    "focus:brown"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小熊身上，是棕色的："
    },
    {
     "en": "brown"
    },
    {
     "en": "a brown bear"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:bright",
    "focus:bright"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "阳光照着，颜色亮亮的，是明亮的："
    },
    {
     "en": "bright"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:white",
    "edge:bright>white",
    "focus:white"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最亮的颜色，是白色，像天上的白云："
    },
    {
     "en": "white"
    },
    {
     "zh": "开头的 w 后面跟着一个 h，这个 h 不发音。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:gold",
    "edge:bright>gold",
    "focus:gold"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "闪闪发光的金色，像金牌："
    },
    {
     "en": "gold"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:silver",
    "edge:gold>silver",
    "focus:silver"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "比金色淡一点的，是银色，像银币："
    },
    {
     "en": "silver"
    },
    {
     "en": "gold and silver"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:dark",
    "focus:dark"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "天黑了，颜色暗暗的，是深色的、黑暗的："
    },
    {
     "en": "dark"
    },
    {
     "en": "dark blue",
     "cue": [
      "focus:dark,blue"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:black",
    "edge:dark>black",
    "focus:black"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最深的颜色，是黑色，像夜里的小黑猫："
    },
    {
     "en": "black"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "edge:dark>brown",
    "focus:dark,brown"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "棕色，也是深深的颜色："
    },
    {
     "en": "brown"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:red,orange,yellow,green,blue,purple"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我们把彩虹的颜色，从外到里读一遍："
    },
    {
     "en": "red",
     "cue": [
      "focus:red"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "orange",
